abstract: >-
  Written on the Wall II, the list of conjectures of the program Graffiti.pc,
  records Conjectures 319, 352, 358, 359 and 427 as open. We show that all
  five are false. The counterexamples are caterpillars for Conjectures 352,
  358, 359 and 427, and graphs built from complete graphs for Conjecture 319;
  each comes in an infinite family, and for Conjectures 358, 359 and 427 the
  difference between the two sides is unbounded.
